# Build-context exclusions for THIS directory (memory-book-5c plan, Step 3).
# book-renderer/ itself is pulled in separately as a named build context
# (`--build-context bookrenderer=../book-renderer`) — see Dockerfile's header
# comment and book-renderer/.dockerignore for the PII exclusion that governs
# THAT context. This file only governs render/memory-book-renderer/'s own
# tree.
